config/layouts/tinkery-t3.json is a modified derivative of Herdr T3 by
JinJieBeWater: https://github.com/JinJieBeWater/herdr-t3
Pinned original revision: 287f0f3653daae33f39f24daaee3d6b556094610
Changes: personal layout identity, separate preview reference, a top-right
sun/moon theme-button block, tighter pane framing, and the tinkery-pane header.

config/mods/tinkery-pane/ is a modified copy of Herdr T3's t3-pane at the
pinned revision (main.js, name.js, tree.js). Changes: a right-click pane menu,
button tooltips, Open Tinkery / Change checkout actions, and hiding (parking)
Tinkery panes instead of closing them. tests/pane.cjs extends T3's check-pane.cjs.

config/mods/tinkery-agent-list/ and config/mods/tinkery-inbox/ are modified
copies of T3's t3-agents and t3-inbox at the pinned revision (main.js,
name.js, tree.js). Changes: targeted right-click agent menus and personal
mod routing. config/mods/tinkery-agent-menu/tree.js is T3's unchanged
status-tree helper. Other upstream T3 mods are not modified or vendored.
The cloned_from version is the Herdr application version, not the T3 revision.

config/layouts/tinkery-t3.svg is an unchanged copy of the upstream layout
preview illustration. It is schematic, not a screenshot of a real session,
and does not depict the added button or Tinkery palette.

